?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=C-RE9Ts_GQ4Q7kNvwHmVOVT&_nc_oc=AdpumKX_Sf6X-CisIHeG88uObD0-GxKNssvwLDQerqVXv3IHFpVGX0ZL3CtiqLcTPSw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af35X8YMps3sX-7uZi13mk79gJR3qvLCs3SvlKvShMcTkA&oe=69EB5BB6"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_XtadiumGER.png", "id": "1376324477410702", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307466_1376324484077368_8828527490190014389_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=90G0BddqZ1AQ7kNvwHt79D4&_nc_oc=Adq8ejcd11T6X1gWyKYNYLBGw7ohQp7IsRd9DKGKSKeAgUIwnq1m2e3L1I9NM2dqSJ8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af34FUuydHWDoYb6AlgMlSiFpdAYBzx75La2DYutK-h2ug&oe=69EB75F3"}, "display_name": "Xtadium Immersive Sports", "keywords": ["sports", "live", "events", "football", "sport"], "long_description": "Xtadium Germany brings you closer to football, handball, action sports, live events and more through immersive VR experiences that put you right inside the action. Whether you\u2019re stepping onto the pitch, entering the tunnel, or watching from the front row, Xtadium transforms every moment into a powerful, immersive experience.\n\nNow featuring immersive content from:\n- **EuroLeague Basketball**\n- **Baller League**\n- **Paris Saint-Germain (PSG)**\n- **DAZN (sports highlights & premium moments)**\n- **THW Kiel (handball)**\n- **Australian Open**\n- **Extreme Sports**\n- **YouTube & sports channels**\n\nGet exclusive access to behind-the-scenes content, training sessions, and unique perspectives you can\u2019t see on TV. With Xtadium, you\u2019re not just watching, you\u2019re **inside** the game. \n\nPowered by YBVR and featured as one of Meta\u2019s top Mixed Reality apps, Xtadium transforms your Meta Quest headset into the ultimate sports arena. Xtadium Germany is the future of sports viewing, bringing global and local sports to life in a way only VR can.\n\n**Download Xtadium now for free.**\n\nhttps://xtadiumvr.com | @XtadiumVR\n\n{2893349350849829}\n{2069145450689684}", "short_description": "Xtadium Germany puts you inside the action with VR sports from EuroLeague, Baller League, PSG, DAZN, THW Kiel, Australian Open, Red Bull, and more. Step onto the pitch, into training sessions, and witness behind-the-scenes moments. You\u2019re not just watching, you\u2019re in the game. Experience it now and download free on Meta."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "PSG VR Celebration.png", "id": "2188826968295823", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491830146_2188826971629156_4072977555062799449_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kgBf004v2iYQ7kNvwExJIgb&_nc_oc=AdqyJcpne48_zfUB4IW46R4ViqjTGioL8Vfqioj3Qw1FPQw-buCuWPtowmVC6vsxjFU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af2Oo6Ql-4keFloeXXeTh9LJMXH63YA3erP3OVS1omTWiA&oe=69EB8644"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_Xtadium (2).png", "id": "1949681198903870", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819859_1949681202237203_3985734893969667658_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QAvxh5JFj6kQ7kNvwFS3pyK&_nc_oc=Adr5THUWsSskqLLBExp7rZ05DbMW90JSqKSMuYvS_WjwiInXdODD7b3xMjX3OJz1B7I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af1lyEOXMwE3gok_TkxBAUdaDDz-LXBsvsBDTJfy0MsLDA&oe=69EB7496"}, {"file_name": "XtadiumUK_Layout.png", "id": "1738072053742430", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822307_1738072060409096_6086162510943715484_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9ByIU7CwXP0Q7kNvwHSnu3T&_nc_oc=Ado0u5Wq52ALFZE7gEdbDO3wnuexAqbnzgGkHhq0XRMoryuA_KR3iWsy-_5l-TZtWC8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af19rq-LqU0VbS3BHbgHvGU7nmzG1exqijZaZvdytBQXHA&oe=69EB6B41"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Square_Xtadium (2).pn