56092602952545_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_E-1TG35SOgQ7kNvwE2DPIj&_nc_oc=AdpF8C4HGECjtlPD0Sd2r86Ohd2xypjxgEZedXVDEsMvdQEyKe5U6La_wW_1WUs0z_c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af1CeSIRrAHrDGlLw8icBXbBrpOLxtIAAzd121coCF9bpw&oe=69EB7450"}, {"file_name": "Watching Wimbledon.png", "id": "1616452409327686", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499620486_1616452412661019_5403591401812963559_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QOsKmea4x8sQ7kNvwE_TqHg&_nc_oc=AdpEvbl3V6l5lc27Plvx3ItC0JR6b9oQRFprmSydRRbCHDM--yQGaQRSd4Lv4nMDrbs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0aOxBjKl5wEvAhFqm8nMzqm9tQPYAnp11DCM4AJaA5Mw&oe=69EB6EDC"}, {"file_name": "Baller League photo.png", "id": "1614934883098849", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307339_1614934886432182_1581813708968533387_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Ti_ahnn8ylMQ7kNvwEHyP2i&_nc_oc=AdqDRZXjwP86cyCeraMxx-ttjJ7QLB4bCd9Q_5utK_weIiCziMOswC0xR7Z-nq1olCs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af0QA83xKmwAVoqKukOUbtqSGMOwArqUvlxb9ntc1wScnQ&oe=69EB62D1"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_Xtadium (2).png", "id": "1257171295544590", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619014_1257171298877923_2118434111013995648_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-MsnsWzQ-o4Q7kNvwHbyOH6&_nc_oc=AdrHgaDEAmUbbS8SjvxYQ-F5kYjLKca3rta1yXHYL_PnTf5PtbYHYHZ9NjUuM7-adIc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3zaByTOsJmSvlrcoq9AWcMdoIruezuLAEYrIMdwe5WRg&oe=69EB6E03"}, "display_name": "Xtadium Immersive Sports", "keywords": ["media", "live", "football", "tennis", "replay"], "long_description": "**Xtadium \u2013 The Ultimate Immersive Sports Experience Now in the UK**\n\n**Xtadium** has arrived in the UK, bringing the **future of sports** to Meta Quest headsets. Whether you love tennis, boxing, football, or extreme sports, Xtadium puts you **front row** with **live and on-demand events in 180\u00ba and 360\u00ba**, multi-camera viewing, real-time stats, and Watch Parties with friends.\n\nDeveloped by **YBVR** and recognised as one of Meta\u2019s top Mixed Reality apps, Xtadium takes you from your living room to courtside, ringside, pitchside \u2014 anywhere the action is.\n\n**Featured content includes:**\n\n\ud83c\udfbe **Wimbledon** \u2013 Immersive highlights and behind-the-scenes access from 2022 & 2023.\n\n\u26bd **Wrexham** - Exclusive content from the back-to-back-to-back promotion.\n\n\ud83e\udd4a **DAZN Boxing** \u2013 Feel every punch with exclusive multi-angle coverage.\n\n\u26bd **PSG: Champions Season** \u2013 Go inside Paris Saint-Germain\u2019s title-winning campaign.\n\n\ud83d\udef9 **X Games (Summer & Winter)** \u2013 Skateboarding, BMX, skiing, snowboarding.\n\n\ud83c\udfc0 **EuroLeague Basketball** \u2013 Courtside views from Europe\u2019s elite league.\n\n\ud83e\uddd7\u200d\u2642\ufe0f **Extreme Sports** \u2013 Skydiving, climbing, and more.\n\n\ud83d\udcfa **YouTube Sports (2D)** \u2013 Live and on-demand from top creators.\n\n**Free on Meta Quest Store. Your living room is now the best seat in the house.**\n\nhttps://xtadiumvr.com | @XtadiumVR\n{1317754983691490}\n{1120787646590402}\n{2188826968295823}", "short_description": "Xtadium takes your favourite sports to a whole new level with cutting-edge Virtual Reality and Mixed Reality features.\n\nPut on your headset to relive Wimbledon, step into the ring with DAZN Boxing, experience PSG\u2019s championship season, and dive into the action from the X Games, Wrexham, and more. \nWhether you\u2019re a die-hard fan or a casual viewer, Xtadium transforms the way you experience sports."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://ybvr.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Yerba Buena VR, Inc.", "su